---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Intelligence Architecture Audit — CC3PO" description="Most businesses have AI tools but no intelligence system. We audit your AI stack, find the gaps, and build your custom 4-floor intelligence architecture. Starting at $2,000.">

  <section class="ia-hero" id="main-content">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ia-hero__badge">
        <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
        New Service — Intelligence Architecture
      </div>
      <h1>Your Business Has AI.<br/><span class="typed-gradient">But Does It Have an Intelligence System?</span></h1>
      <p class="ia-hero__sub">Most businesses are collecting AI tools like garage gadgets — impressive individually, disconnected collectively. An intelligence architecture turns those tools into a system that thinks, learns, and acts for your business.</p>
      <div class="ia-hero__buttons">
        <a href="#book" class="btn btn-primary btn-glow">Book Your Intelligence Architecture Audit</a>
        <a href="#floors" class="btn btn-secondary">See How It Works</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ia-problem" id="problem">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">The Problem</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">AI Without Architecture Is Just Noise</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">You've bought the tools. ChatGPT for copy. Co-pilot for code. Maybe a chatbot on your website. But none of them talk to each other. None of them know your business. And none of them get smarter over time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ia-problem__grid">
        <div class="ia-problem__card">
          <div class="ia-problem__icon">🧩</div>
          <h3>Fragmented Tools</h3>
          <p>Every AI tool works in isolation. Your chatbot doesn't know what your email agent knows. Your data stays trapped in silos.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ia-problem__card">
          <div class="ia-problem__icon">🔇</div>
          <h3>No Institutional Memory</h3>
          <p>Your AI can't learn from your business data, policies, or past decisions. Every conversation starts from zero.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ia-problem__card">
          <div class="ia-problem__icon">🤖</div>
          <h3>Generic Outputs</h3>
          <p>Out-of-the-box AI gives generic answers. It doesn't know your brand voice, your processes, or your customers.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ia-problem__card">
          <div class="ia-problem__icon">⏸️</div>
          <h3>No Execution Layer</h3>
          <p>AI that can only talk but can't act. It can't send emails, update CRMs, or book appointments on your behalf.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ia-floors" id="floors">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">The 4-Floor Architecture</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">An Intelligence System, Not Just Tools</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">The intelligence architecture has four floors — each building on the one below. When all four work together, your business gains an intelligence layer that compounds over time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ia-floors__stack">
        <div class="ia-floor ia-floor--4">
          <div class="ia-floor__number">4</div>
          <div class="ia-floor__content">
            <div class="ia-floor__icon">⚡</div>
            <h3>Execution Floor</h3>
            <span class="ia-floor__tag">AI That Acts</span>
            <p>AI that works inside your tools — sending emails, updating CRMs, booking appointments, processing orders. This is where intelligence becomes business impact.</p>
            <ul class="ia-floor__examples">
              <li>Automated email sequences</li>
              <li>CRM updates & lead routing</li>
              <li>Calendar booking & scheduling</li>
              <li>Document generation & filing</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ia-floor ia-floor--3">
          <div class="ia-floor__number">3</div>
          <div class="ia-floor__content">
            <div class="ia-floor__icon">🎯</div>
            <h3>Specialization Floor</h3>
            <span class="ia-floor__tag">AI That Knows You</span>
            <p>Custom agents configured for YOUR business — your workflows, your terminology, your compliance requirements. Not a chatbot. A trained specialist.</p>
            <ul class="ia-floor__examples">
              <li>Custom AI agents per department</li>
              <li>Business-specific workflows</li>
              <li>Compliance-aware automation</li>
              <li>Brand voice & tone calibration</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ia-floor ia-floor--2">
          <div class="ia-floor__number">2</div>
          <div class="ia-floor__content">
            <div class="ia-floor__icon">🔍</div>
            <h3>Exploration Floor</h3>
            <span class="ia-floor__tag">AI That Discovers</span>
            <p>Context-aware AI that can find patterns across your data, connect dots humans miss, and surface insights proactively. This is where your data starts working for you.</p>
            <ul class="ia-floor__examples">
              <li>Cross-data pattern recognition</li>
              <li>Predictive insights & alerts</li>
              <li>Market & competitor analysis</li>
              <li>Anomaly detection</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ia-floor ia-floor--1">
          <div class="ia-floor__number">1</div>
          <div class="ia-floor__content">
            <div class="ia-floor__icon">📚</div>
            <h3>Knowledge Grounding Floor</h3>
            <span class="ia-floor__tag">AI That Knows Your Truth</span>
            <p>Your docs, your data, your truth. This floor grounds every AI interaction in your actual business knowledge — policies, procedures, past decisions, customer history. No hallucinations. No guesswork.</p>
            <ul class="ia-floor__examples">
              <li>Business knowledge base</li>
              <li>Policy & procedure grounding</li>
              <li>Customer history context</li>
              <li>Regulatory compliance data</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ia-audit" id="audit">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">The Audit</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">We Map Your Intelligence Architecture</h2>
        <p class="section-desc">In one focused session, we assess where your business stands on each floor, identify the gaps that are costing you money, and design the architecture that ties it all together.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ia-audit__steps">
        <div class="ia-audit__step">
          <div class="ia-audit__step-number">01</div>
          <div class="ia-audit__step-content">
            <h3>Discovery Session</h3>
            <p>90-minute deep dive into your current AI tools, data sources, workflows, and business objectives. We learn how your business actually runs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ia-audit__step">
          <div class="ia-audit__step-number">02</div>
          <div class="ia-audit__step-content">
            <h3>Floor Assessment</h3>
            <p>We evaluate each of the four floors — what you have, what's missing, and what's disconnected. Most businesses discover they're operating on floor 1 with gaps everywhere.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ia-audit__step">
          <div class="ia-audit__step-number">03</div>
          <div class="ia-audit__step-content">
            <h3>Architecture Blueprint</h3>
            <p>A custom blueprint showing how to connect your existing tools, fill the gaps, and build an intelligence system that compounds — getting smarter every month.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ia-audit__step">
          <div class="ia-audit__step-number">04</div>
          <div class="ia-audit__step-content">
            <h3>Implementation Roadmap</h3>
            <p>Phase-by-phase rollout plan with timelines, dependencies, and ROI projections. You know exactly what to build first and what it'll deliver.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ia-deliverables">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">What You Get</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Deliverables That Drive Action</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="ia-deliverables__grid">
        <div class="ia-deliverable">
          <div class="ia-deliverable__icon">📋</div>
          <h3>Full Audit Report</h3>
          <p>Detailed assessment of your current AI stack, data infrastructure, and workflow automation — floor by floor.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ia-deliverable">
          <div class="ia-deliverable__icon">🏗️</div>
          <h3>Architecture Blueprint</h3>
          <p>Visual map of your target intelligence architecture — how every tool, data source, and agent connects.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ia-deliverable">
          <div class="ia-deliverable__icon">🗺️</div>
          <h3>Implementation Roadmap</h3>
          <p>Phased rollout plan with priorities, timelines, and clear ROI at each stage. No guesswork.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ia-deliverable">
          <div class="ia-deliverable__icon">🔄</div>
          <h3>30-Day Follow-Up</h3>
          <p>One month after delivery, we review progress, answer questions, and adjust the roadmap based on real results.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ia-pricing" id="pricing">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">Investment</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Start with the Audit</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="ia-pricing__card">
        <div class="ia-pricing__header">
          <h3>Intelligence Architecture Audit</h3>
          <p>Full assessment, blueprint, and roadmap</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ia-pricing__price">
          <span class="ia-pricing__amount">$2,000</span>
          <span class="ia-pricing__note">one-time</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="ia-pricing__includes">
          <li>✓ 90-minute discovery session</li>
          <li>✓ 4-floor assessment of your AI stack</li>
          <li>✓ Custom architecture blueprint</li>
          <li>✓ Phased implementation roadmap</li>
          <li>✓ 30-day follow-up review</li>
          <li>✓ Executive summary for stakeholders</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="https://buy.stripe.com/28EcN4awe8Zhb9GggI1B60S" class="btn btn-primary btn-glow ia-pricing__cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy Now — $2,000</a>
        <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 12px;">Or <a href="#book" style="color: var(--cyan-400);">request a consultation first</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ia-cta" id="book">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="bottom-cta-form">
        <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -1px; margin-bottom: 8px;">Book Your Intelligence Architecture Audit</h2>
        <p style="text-align: center; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 15px;">Tell us about your business and we'll schedule your discovery session.</p>
        <form class="lead-form" id="audit-form">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="audit-name">Full Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="audit-name" name="name" required placeholder="Your name" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="audit-email">Work Email</label>
            <input type="email" id="audit-email" name="email" required placeholder="you@company.com" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="audit-company">Company</label>
            <input type="text" id="audit-company" name="company" placeholder="Company name" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="audit-size">Team Size</label>
            <select id="audit-size" name="team_size">
              <option value="1-5">1–5 people</option>
              <option value="6-25">6–25 people</option>
              <option value="26-100">26–100 people</option>
              <option value="100+">100+ people</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group full">
            <label for="audit-challenge">What's your biggest AI challenge right now?</label>
            <textarea id="audit-challenge" name="challenge" rows="3" placeholder="Tell us what's not working..."></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="consent-group">
            <input type="checkbox" id="audit-consent" name="consent" required />
            <label for="audit-consent">I agree to be contacted about the Intelligence Architecture Audit. No spam, ever.</label>
          </div>
          <div class="form-actions">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-glow">Submit Request</button>
          </div>
          <div class="form-message" id="audit-form-message"></div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    const form = document.getElementById('audit-form');
    const msg = document.getElementById('audit-form-message');
    if (form) {
      form.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
        e.preventDefault();
        const btn = form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
        btn.classList.add('is-loading');
        btn.disabled = true;
        msg.textContent = '';
        msg.className = 'form-message';

        try {
          const res = await fetch('https://formspree.io/f/xpwdjqdl', {
            method: 'POST',
            body: new FormData(form),
            headers: { 'Accept': 'application/json' }
          });
          if (res.ok) {
            msg.textContent = '✓ Request submitted! We\'ll be in touch within 24 hours.';
            msg.classList.add('success');
            form.reset();
          } else {
            msg.textContent = 'Something went wrong. Please try again or email us directly.';
            msg.classList.add('error');
          }
        } catch {
          msg.textContent = 'Network error. Please check your connection and try again.';
          msg.classList.add('error');
        }
        btn.classList.remove('is-loading');
        btn.disabled = false;
      });
    }
  </script>

  <script>
    // Scroll reveal
    const revealEls = document.querySelectorAll('.ia-problem__card, .ia-floor, .ia-audit__step, .ia-deliverable');
    const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach(entry => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          entry.target.classList.add('revealed');
          observer.unobserve(entry.target);
        }
      });
    }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -40px 0px' });
    revealEls.forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
  </script>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* ===== HERO ===== */
  .ia-hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 90vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: calc(var(--nav-height) + var(--space-4xl)) var(--space-lg) var(--space-3xl);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #050508 0%, #1a0a2e 50%, #050508 100%);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .ia-hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 0%, rgba(107,53,255,0.15) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .ia-hero__badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: var(--space-xs) var(--space-md);
    background: rgba(107,53,255,0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(107,53,255,0.35);
    border-radius: 100px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #a78bfa;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }
  .ia-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 56px);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .ia-hero__sub {
    font-size: clamp(15px, 1.8vw, 18px);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-2xl);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .ia-hero__buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  /* ===== PROBLEM ===== */
  .ia-problem {
    padding: var(--space-4xl) 0;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
  }
  .ia-problem__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }
  .ia-problem__card {
    padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-md);
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease, border-color var(--duration-normal), box-shadow var(--duration-normal);
  }
  .ia-problem__card.revealed { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  .ia-problem__card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(255,82,82,0.25);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(255,82,82,0.1);
  }
  .ia-problem__icon { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: var(--space-md); }
  .ia-problem__card h3 { font-size: var(--text-base); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); color: #fff; }
  .ia-problem__card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* ===== 4 FLOORS ===== */
  .ia-floors {
    padding: var(--space-4xl) 0;
    background: var(--bg-primary);
  }
  .ia-floors__stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .ia-floor {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg-card);
    overflow: hidden;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease, border-color var(--duration-normal), box-shadow var(--duration-normal);
  }
  .ia-floor.revealed { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  .ia-floor:hover {
    border-color: rgba(107,53,255,0.3);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(107,53,255,0.08);
  }
  .ia-floor__number {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-width: 72px;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 800;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .ia-floor--4 .ia-floor__number { background: rgba(79,195,247,0.08); color: rgba(79,195,247,0.4); }
  .ia-floor--3 .ia-floor__number { background: rgba(167,139,250,0.08); color: rgba(167,139,250,0.4); }
  .ia-floor--2 .ia-floor__number { background: rgba(233,69,96,0.08); color: rgba(233,69,96,0.4); }
  .ia-floor--1 .ia-floor__number { background: rgba(0,230,118,0.08); color: rgba(0,230,118,0.4); }
  .ia-floor__content {
    padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-lg);
    flex: 1;
  }
  .ia-floor__icon { font-size: 28px; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); }
  .ia-floor__content h3 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xs);
    color: #fff;
  }
  .ia-floor__tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 100px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  .ia-floor--4 .ia-floor__tag { background: rgba(79,195,247,0.1); color: #4fc3f7; border: 1px solid rgba(79,195,247,0.2); }
  .ia-floor--3 .ia-floor__tag { background: rgba(167,139,250,0.1); color: #a78bfa; border: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,0.2); }
  .ia-floor--2 .ia-floor__tag { background: rgba(233,69,96,0.1); color: #e94560; border: 1px solid rgba(233,69,96,0.2); }
  .ia-floor--1 .ia-floor__tag { background: rgba(0,230,118,0.1); color: #00e676; border: 1px solid rgba(0,230,118,0.2); }
  .ia-floor__content p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  .ia-floor__examples {
    list-style: none;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 6px 16px;
  }
  .ia-floor__examples li {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding-left: 16px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .ia-floor__examples li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 8px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }
  .ia-floor--4 .ia-floor__examples li::before { background: #4fc3f7; }
  .ia-floor--3 .ia-floor__examples li::before { background: #a78bfa; }
  .ia-floor--2 .ia-floor__examples li::before { background: #e94560; }
  .ia-floor--1 .ia-floor__examples li::before { background: #00e676; }

  /* ===== AUDIT STEPS ===== */
  .ia-audit {
    padding: var(--space-4xl) 0;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
  }
  .ia-audit__steps {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }
  .ia-audit__step {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(16px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease, border-color var(--duration-normal);
  }
  .ia-audit__step.revealed { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  .ia-audit__step:hover { border-color: rgba(107,53,255,0.25); }
  .ia-audit__step-number {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    line-height: 1;
    min-width: 48px;
  }
  .ia-audit__step-content h3 { font-size: var(--text-lg); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); color: #fff; }
  .ia-audit__step-content p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7; }

  /* ===== DELIVERABLES ===== */
  .ia-deliverables {
    padding: var(--space-4xl) 0;
    background: var(--bg-primary);
  }
  .ia-deliverables__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }
  .ia-deliverable {
    padding: var(--space-xl) var(--space-md);
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    text-align: center;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(16px);
    transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease, border-color var(--duration-normal), box-shadow var(--duration-normal);
  }
  .ia-deliverable.revealed { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  .ia-deliverable:hover {
    border-color: rgba(167,139,250,0.25);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(167,139,250,0.08);
  }
  .ia-deliverable__icon { font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: var(--space-md); }
  .ia-deliverable h3 { font-size: var(--text-base); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); color: #fff; }
  .ia-deliverable p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.6; }

  /* ===== PRICING ===== */
  .ia-pricing {
    padding: var(--space-4xl) 0;
    background: var(--bg-secondary);
